---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="AI Solutions for Masjids & Islamic Centers" description="Calls answered, events organized and donors followed up, without adding work for volunteers. Your community's data stays isolated, encrypted and yours." primaryLabel="Book a conversation" mobilePrimary="Book a conversation" secondaryLabel="Request a board presentation" secondaryHref="/book-a-discovery-call?board=yes">
<section aria-labelledby="h1" style="padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) 0 clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">Masjids &amp; Islamic centers</span></nav>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);align-items:center">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">For masjids and Islamic centers</p>
<h1 id="h1" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Technology that serves your community — securely.</h1>
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,22px);line-height:1.45;color:#0F4C45;max-width:52ch">Your masjid's calls answered, events organized and donors followed up, without adding work for your volunteers.</p>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,18px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:58ch">Hazirminds works with boards, committees and administrators at masjids (mosques) and Islamic centers. We start with what your community needs, then put one right-sized solution in place.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
<a class="x1" href="/book-a-discovery-call" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none">Book a conversation</a>
<a class="x2" href="/book-a-discovery-call?board=yes" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none">Request a board presentation</a>
</div>
<p style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">lock</span>Your community's data stays yours: isolated, encrypted and never shared.</p>
</div>
<div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;max-height:620px;width:100%">
<image-slot id="masjid-hero" shape="rounded" radius="20" placeholder="Photo of masjid architecture or a community space · used with permission · no identifiable people without consent"></image-slot>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="ch-h" style="background:#E8F2EE;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px"><h2 id="ch-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Common challenges, and how we help</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">What we hear from masjid boards and administrators.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:8px clamp(20px,3vw,40px)">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:12px 48px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#585E5A">phone_missed</span><b style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Calls go unanswered: prayer times, events, services and general questions</b></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F4C45">arrow_forward</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F3633">The AI Receptionist answers 24/7 and routes to staff when needed.</p></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:12px 48px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#585E5A">apps</span><b style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Separate systems for donations, events, messaging and contacts</b></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F4C45">arrow_forward</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F3633">One connected system.</p></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:12px 48px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#585E5A">event_busy</span><b style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Fundraisers and events without consistent follow-up</b></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F4C45">arrow_forward</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F3633">Automated, consent-based confirmations, reminders and follow-ups.</p></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:12px 48px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#585E5A">groups</span><b style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">A small staff and volunteers handling a lot</b></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F4C45">arrow_forward</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F3633">Role-based access, with AI handling repetitive front-line tasks.</p></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:12px 48px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#585E5A">language</span><b style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">A website that doesn't engage the community</b></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F4C45">arrow_forward</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F3633">An AI-powered website with chat and voice.</p></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:12px 48px;padding:24px 0"><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#585E5A">visibility</span><b style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Concern about who sees community data</b></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F4C45">arrow_forward</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F3633">An isolated environment per masjid, encryption, an audit trail, and data owned by the masjid.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="gov-h" style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#DCE7E4">Governance</p><h2 id="gov-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Governance built for masjids</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4;max-width:44ch">Clear rules your board can review, and that the system enforces.</p></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#D6A552">menu_book</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">The AI answers only from information your masjid approves. If you'd prefer that it not answer religious questions, we can set it up that way, passing them to a scholar or imam you designate, with every routing logged.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#D6A552">deployed_code</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">One masjid can never see another's data, contacts, communications or records, enforced at the database level.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#D6A552">badge</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">A volunteer sees only what a volunteer needs. Administrators have administrator access.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#D6A552">phone_callback</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">The AI answers inbound calls only, with no unsolicited outbound calls or messages. Your masjid maintains consents with its own community.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#D6A552">key</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6">Your masjid owns all its data and gets a full export within 90 days of leaving. Its data is never used to train models for others without written opt-in.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="host-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px"><h2 id="host-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Managed cloud or your own server</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Both are possible. Here's how they compare.</p></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#0F4C45">cloud</span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:28px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#E3EDE9;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:13px">Most masjids choose this</span></div><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Our managed cloud</h3><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#2F3633"><li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Managed AWS in the US</li><li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Automatic updates</li><li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Continuous monitoring</li><li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Redundant backups</li><li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>No IT staff needed</li></ul></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#0F4C45">dns</span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:28px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#F0EAE0;color:#585E5A;font-weight:600;font-size:13px">Scoped with you</span></div><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Your own server</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">If you'd rather keep your data on your own server, we can scope that setup with you. A local server needs dedicated IT staff to patch, secure, back up and monitor it, and your team or IT provider looks after it.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="val-h" style="background:#EAF0F8;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="val-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:48px">Value for your masjid</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><span style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#D5EDE3;color:#0F6B57;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F6B57">hub</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Fewer tools to pay for and manage</h3><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Separate tools replaced by one connected system.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><span style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#FBE0D6;color:#A23E1E;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#A23E1E">forward_to_inbox</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Follow-up while the moment is fresh</h3><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Consistent, consent-based follow-up after fundraisers and events, so attendees hear from you while the moment is fresh.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="board-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:32px;align-items:center;padding:clamp(28px,4vw,56px);background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:24px">
<div style="display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:#DBE8F7;color:#2B5C8F;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#2B5C8F">co_present</span></span><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><h2 id="board-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">For boards and committees</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We present to your board or committee and leave a one-page summary.</p></div></div>
<a class="x3" href="/book-a-discovery-call?board=yes" style="justify-self:start;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none">Request a board presentation<span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px">arrow_forward</span></a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="faq-h" style="background:#FBEEE7;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="faq-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Questions masjid boards ask</h2><a href="/masjids/faq" style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px">All masjid questions →</a></div>
<div class="faq-span" style="border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6">
<details open="" style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x4" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Is our data safe?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">Yes. It's encrypted in transit and at rest, stored on US cloud infrastructure (AWS), and isolated in your own environment that no other organization can access. Access is role-based and enforced by the system.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x5" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Can another masjid see our information?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">No. Every organization has its own isolated environment, enforced at the database level.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x6" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Does the AI answer religious questions?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">If you'd prefer that the AI not answer religious questions, we can set it up that way. Those questions then go to a scholar or imam your masjid designates, and every routing is logged.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x7" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Does the AI receptionist call or text people on its own?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">No. It answers inbound calls. All automated messages follow workflows your masjid approves.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x8" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">What happens if we decide to leave?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">You own your data. You get a full export in a standard format within a 90-day window. Your data is never held hostage.</p></details>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="cta-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,360px),1fr));gap:32px;align-items:center">
<h2 id="cta-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,44px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Let's talk about what your community needs.</h2>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px"><a class="x9" href="/book-a-discovery-call" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:56px;padding:0 32px;border-radius:999px;background:#FAF7F2;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;text-decoration:none">Book a conversation<span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px">arrow_forward</span></a></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

</Base>

<style>
.x1:hover{background:#0B3A35 !important;color:#FAF7F2 !important}
.x2:hover{background:#E3EDE9 !important;color:#0B3A35 !important}
.x3:hover{background:#0B3A35 !important;color:#FAF7F2 !important}
.x4:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x5:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x6:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x7:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x8:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x9:hover{background:#E3EDE9 !important;color:#0B3A35 !important}
</style>
